  "title": "Chicken and Broccoli Stir Fry",
  "description": "This chicken and broccoli recipe stir fries tender pieces of chicken, onion, fresh ginger, and broccoli florets in a sweet and spicy soy-garlic sauce.",
  "authors": [
    "Jeri"
  ],
